 a product that I  am not using and getting a lot of value  from and that was one of my main  going there to understand can these  other products help me in my business  and can they potentially help you in  your business because I'd love to share  that so I want to tell the story of  three different salespeople that I met  there the first person took the approach  of I'm going to convince you that  Microsoft is the best I have such  passion for Microsoft and I'm convinced  that we're the best in everything and  I'm gonna convince you by the end of  this conversation with you you're gonna  be convinced that Microsoft is the best  for everything and right away just think  about that attitude right what's your  immediate reaction immediately you're  thinking well that's BS you have your  defense metrics up right now I'm now I'm  worried about what's gonna happen  because I feel like this person doesn't  understand me and I still listen I still  talk to her I was still trying to get  information out but everything she said  I took with a grain of salt because she  made very clear where her intentions  were upfront and now I'm left to figure  out for myself is this gonna be a good  solution for me or not where the next  two guys that I met took an opposite  approach one guy was focused on hardware  Microsoft phones and technology and the  other guys focused on their online tools  and both of them started the  conversation with listen I don't know if  Microsoft is gonna be a fit for you but  I love to learn a little bit more about  your business and learn about the  problems that you're facing and see if  we might be able to help right away I'm  feeling a lot more safe and secure I'm  feeling that my guards are let down more  and that's what I wanted I want an open  conversation be able to explain what I'm  going through what I'm using now and can  you help me can you be the solution for  me and so I think too many entrepreneurs  take that first approach the approach of 